.py                 # N40\n68\t  test_plan26_adversarial.py         # N50\n69\t\n70\tplans/26_langgraph_curriculum_factory/\n71\t  contracts/                          # N00 (this directory)\n72\t  results/{node_id}.result.v1.md      # every node\n73\t```\n74\t\n75\tNo `context.py` file (see [[node_ownership.v1]] \"context.py gap\").\n76\tNo `nodes/repair.py` or `nodes/workbook.py` (basenames reserved for the\n77\ttop-level engine modules instead).\n78\t\n79\t## Frozen names used across node prompts\n80\t\n81\t- Builder entry point: `runtime.langgraph_factory.graph.build_curriculum_factory_graph(*, engine_root: Path, output_root: Path) -> CompiledStateGraph`.\n82\t- Pre-invocation helper: `runtime.langgraph_factory.persistence.prepare_episode_invocation()`.\n83\t- CLI module: `python3 -m runtime.run_curriculum`.\n84\t- Compiled graph `name=` argument: `\"plan26_curriculum_factory\"` (spec section 3.3).\n85\t- Checkpoint DB path: `<output_root>/.langgraph/checkpoints.sqlite3`; lock:\n86\t  `<output_root>/.langgraph/execution.lock`.\n87\t- Thread ID format: `f\"{run_id}:episode:{episode_ordinal:06d}\"`; orphan\n88\t  recovery: `f\"{run_id}:recover:{orphan_episode_ordinal}\"`.\n89\t- `checkpoint_ns` is always `\"\"`.\n90\t\n91\t## Forbidden production imports (repeated from graph rule, binding on every node)\n92\t\n93\t`langchain`, `langchain_openai`, `langchain_google_genai`, `openai`,\n94\t`google.generativeai`. N10's lock-drift/API-contract tests are the\n95\tenforcement point; every other node MUST NOT introduce these regardless.\n96\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"913d8145-a69b-41ae-866d-8d539cb6c5e2","uuid":"e8ba2817-4321-4706-a10a-f9c0de8bc3ec","timestamp":"2026-08-12T15:03:46.530Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"plans/26_langgraph_curriculum_factory/contracts/shared_names_and_paths.v1.md","content":"# N00 frozen shared names and paths\n\nCanonical reference for every later node. Derived from\n`implementation.graph.v2.yaml` wri